403 egress denied
destination: %H:%p
control:     ratelimit (this agent's concurrent-connection ceiling is already in use)
policy:      @POLICY_PATH@  (profile "@PROFILE@")
remediation: raise rate_limits.<agent>.max_concurrent in profiles/@PROFILE@.yaml, then recompile
             a ceiling reached repeatedly is a signal before it is a setting
record:      the mediator's audit line for this attempt is the authoritative denial record
